{"hw":"οὐδεπώποτε","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οὐδεπώποτε</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οὐδεπώποτε</span>, Conj. and <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">and not yet ever, never yet at any time</b>, usu. of the past, as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">250</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.22</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">313c</span> </span>: later of the <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐδεπώποτε ἀπολαύσομεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Them.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26.330a</span> </span>; v. οὐδέποτε.</div></div>"}